WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:02.794
Here's how YardSwaps works, start to finish,

2
00:00:02.794 --> 00:00:05.936
with one pressure washer that's been sitting in the garage.

3
00:00:07.086 --> 00:00:10.477
Tap Sell. Before you take photos, open Photo tips.

4
00:00:10.477 --> 00:00:15.767
Get the whole item in the frame, and add a close-up of any label or nameplate.

5
00:00:15.767 --> 00:00:18.005
The AI reads the brand and model.

6
00:00:19.155 --> 00:00:23.842
Choose your photos. Here, one of the whole washer and one of the label.

7
00:00:23.842 --> 00:00:27.671
The AI reads both and fills in the title and the category.

8
00:00:30.388 --> 00:00:33.238
It read the brand, Hotsy, right off the label.

9
00:00:33.238 --> 00:00:35.717
Check what it filled in before you post.

10
00:00:38.088 --> 00:00:41.180
It also suggests a price range from the photos.

11
00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:43.286
Tap Use price, or type your own.

12
00:00:43.286 --> 00:00:46.839
The condition and the description are already written.

13
00:00:48.388 --> 00:00:53.874
Tap Publish. Listing is free, and your listing is live in the feed and in search.

14
00:01:00.988 --> 00:01:06.264
Now the buyer's side. Someone nearby searches pressure washer, finds it two miles away,

15
00:01:06.264 --> 00:01:11.176
and opens it to check the photos, the details, and what to look at before buying.

16
00:01:14.988 --> 00:01:19.412
They can make an offer. Tap an amount or type your own, and send it.

17
00:01:19.412 --> 00:01:21.754
The seller can accept it or counter.

18
00:01:22.904 --> 00:01:25.174
Or message the seller to set a time.

19
00:01:25.174 --> 00:01:27.003
Every deal is a local pickup.

20
00:01:27.003 --> 00:01:31.733
Meet somewhere safe, run the equipment, and pay only when you're satisfied.

21
00:01:33.504 --> 00:01:38.808
Selling as a business? A storefront puts every unit you list under your company name,

22
00:01:38.808 --> 00:01:43.300
with your hours, your service area, a search box, and one link to share.

23
00:01:47.571 --> 00:01:50.128
Start a storefront free for 30 days.

24
00:01:50.128 --> 00:01:56.734
After that, the first 100 storefronts pay our founding price of $29 a month for three months,

25
00:01:56.734 --> 00:01:57.942
then $49 a month.

26
00:01:59.091 --> 00:02:04.420
Get YardSwaps free on the App Store or Google Play, or go to yardswaps.com.
